==Icelandic==

===Verb===
'''brosa'''

# to [[smile]]
#: '''''Brostu''' nú, þú hefur svo fallegt bros.''
#:: Do '''smile''', you have such a lovely smile.
#: ''Þú '''brosir''' fallega.''
#:: You have a pretty '''smile'''.
#: ''Það kostar ekkert að '''brosa'''.''
#:: '''Smiling''' is free.

